# Lychee / markdown-link-check false-positives (bot-walled; load fine in a real browser)
# community.sap.com — Imperva/Akamai returns 403 to link-checker UAs
# github.com/signup — public page, 403 to link-checker UAs
# www.npmjs.com — 403 to link-checker UAs on package pages
# api.reuse.software — 404 until this repo is registered with the REUSE service post-publication
https://community.sap.com/.*
https://github.com/signup
https://www.npmjs.com/package/.*
https://api.reuse.software/info/github.com/SAP-samples/teched2026-XP266

# Relative URL that resolves to the GitHub UI route /{owner}/{repo}/actions/workflows/*.yaml
# (../../../../actions/workflows/*.yaml in ex4/ex5 — intentional, fork-safe: each viewer lands
# on their OWN Actions tab). Lychee resolves these against the local filesystem and emits
# file:///.../actions/workflows/*.yaml which doesn't exist; skip them.
file:///.*/actions/workflows/.*\.yaml
